text:
All my ideas and thoughts should ultimately be brought into one of these formats:

- startup;
- pet project;
- research;
- article;
- Habr post;
- VC.ru post;
- Telegram channel post;
- TikTok or reel;
- meme;
- opinion article;
- book;
- song;
- poem;
- talk at Monoid;
- Avito service.

Overall, I am thinking about my image and digital footprint online.

It would be interesting to start a pet project not by simply taking it and building it, but with market research. If such things already exist, record a video or article about it.

